{"repo":{"name":{"en-US":"NiimStudio fork repository"},"icon":{"en-US":{"name":"/icon.png","sha256":"74d4ce1b440042617cff14c158bd47109abec73e5db6176d81968b1f7a1dfd78","size":8882}},"address":"https://valinok.github.io/NiimStudio/fdroid/repo","description":{"en-US":"Unofficial fork of TobseF/NiimStudio with a Russian UI, stable keyboard panel and printer fixes. No proprietary fonts or traced icons.","de":"Inoffizieller Fork von TobseF/NiimStudio mit russischer Oberfläche, stabiler Tastaturleiste und Drucker-Korrekturen. Keine proprietären Schriften oder abgemalten Icons.","ru":"Неофициальный форк TobseF/NiimStudio с русским интерфейсом, неподвижной панелью при клавиатуре и исправлениями принтера. Без проприетарных шрифтов и обведённых иконок."},"timestamp":1795527749463,"categories":{"Graphics":{"name":{"en-US":"Graphics","de":"Grafik","ru":"Графика"}},"Utilities":{"name":{"en-US":"Utilities","de":"Werkzeuge","ru":"Утилиты"}}}},"packages":{"io.github.tobsef.niimstudio":{"metadata":{"name":{"en-US":"NiimStudio"},"summary":{"en-US":"Design and print labels on NIIMBOT printers","de":"Etiketten für NIIMBOT-Drucker gestalten und drucken","ru":"Этикетки для принтеров NIIMBOT: дизайн и печать"},"description":{"en-US":"Offline label designer for NIIMBOT printers: text, symbols, barcodes, QR codes and cable flags. This fork adds a Russian UI, stable keyboard panel, printer battery status and D110_M support.","de":"Offline-Etikettendesigner für NIIMBOT-Drucker: Text, Symbole, Barcodes, QR-Codes und Kabelmarken. Dieser Fork ergänzt russische Oberfläche, stabile Tastaturleiste, Akkustatus und D110_M-Unterstützung.","ru":"Офлайн-редактор этикеток для принтеров NIIMBOT: текст, символы, штрихкоды, QR-коды и маркеры кабелей. В форке: русский интерфейс, неподвижная панель при клавиатуре, заряд принтера и поддержка D110_M."},"added":1795527749463,"lastUpdated":1795527749463,"license":"GPL-3.0-only","authorName":"Valinok (fork of TobseF)","webSite":"https://github.com/Valinok/NiimStudio","sourceCode":"https://github.com/Valinok/NiimStudio","issueTracker":"https://github.com/Valinok/NiimStudio/issues","categories":["Graphics","Utilities"],"icon":{"en-US":{"name":"/icon.png","sha256":"74d4ce1b440042617cff14c158bd47109abec73e5db6176d81968b1f7a1dfd78","size":8882}}},"versions":{"835a99410121d74d8c7d45bed60d3a3050a4375c36bc21c55127f4a4ad2d4bb7":{"added":1795527749463,"file":{"name":"/NiimStudio-0.7.2-release.apk","sha256":"835a99410121d74d8c7d45bed60d3a3050a4375c36bc21c55127f4a4ad2d4bb7","size":1895922},"manifest":{"versionName":"0.7.2","versionCode":10,"usesSdk":{"minSdkVersion":26,"targetSdkVersion":35},"signer":{"sha256":["f04731c891ebfb25cd323255d0e873c950ccff3386a46c069b8d02d38c12f733"]}},"whatsNew":{"en-US":"0.7.2: D110_M prints exactly the requested number of copies (verified protocol sequence); printer disconnection is detected in about 2 seconds; counter preview is unlimited, the current number can be typed in, advances by 1 after printing and is remembered on exit.","de":"0.7.2: D110_M prints exactly the requested number of copies (verified protocol sequence); printer disconnection is detected in about 2 seconds; counter preview is unlimited, the current number can be typed in, advances by 1 after printing and is remembered on exit.","ru":"0.7.2: D110_M prints exactly the requested number of copies (verified protocol sequence); printer disconnection is detected in about 2 seconds; counter preview is unlimited, the current number can be typed in, advances by 1 after printing and is remembered on exit."}}}}}}
